{"ref":"BDB, יְדַעְיָה","hw":"יְדַעְיָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">יְדַעְיָה</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong>Sab. n.pr. <span dir=\"rtl\">ידעאל</span> DHM<sup>ZMG 1875, 605</sup><strong>)</strong> priestly name;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:10\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.10\">1 Ch 9:10</a> 𝔊 Ιωαδε, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 24:7\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.24.7\">24:7</a> 𝔊 (Ανε)ιδεια.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:36\" href=\"/Ezra.2.36\">Ezr 2:36</a> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:38\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.38\">Ne 7:39</a> 𝔊 Ιεουδα, (Ι)εδδουα, Ιωαδε.<br><strong>3.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 11:10\" href=\"/Nehemiah.11.10\">Ne 11:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:6\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.6\">12:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:19\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.19\">19</a> 𝔊 Δαδεια, Ιαδιας, Ιδειας, etc.<br><strong>4.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:7\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.7\">Ne 12:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:21\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.21\">21</a> 𝔊L Ωδουιας.<br><strong>5.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 6:10\" href=\"/Zechariah.6.10\">Zc 6:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 6:14\" href=\"/Zechariah.6.14\">14</a> 𝔊 (παρὰ) τῶν ἐπεγνωκότων αὐτήν.","next":"BDB, יַדּוּעַ","prev":"BDB, דַּ֫עַת"}